        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b66b8df7-2305-5fb2-b989-ec2ba366bece",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yasuzo Masumura, Peter Glenville, Ayako Wakao, Hal B. Wallis, Joseph H. Hazen\n- Organizations: Daiei Studios\n- Works: Becket (1964 film)\n- Roles: film director, film and stage actor, producer, executive producer\n\nFacts:\n- Yasuzo Masumura was a Japanese film director who was born on August 25, 1924, and died on November 23, 1986.\n- Peter Glenville, born Peter Patrick Brabazon Browne, was an English film and stage actor and director who was born on October 28, 1913, and died on June 3, 1996.\n- In 1951, Ayako Wakao joined Daiei Studios as part of the fifth \"New Face\" group.\n- Ayako Wakao often appeared in films directed by Yasuzo Masumura.\n- Becket, a 1964 film, was directed by Peter Glenville.\n- Becket was produced by Hal B. Wallis, with Joseph H. Hazen serving as executive producer.",
